\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Grid sensitivity study on a representative subdomain of the regular packing with $\theta =40^\circ $. (a)~Geometry showing the extraction plane position for grid convergence assessment. (b-d)~Time-averaged fields of velocity magnitude $v_\mathrm  {mag}$ on the extraction surface for the three grid levels of Table~\ref {tab:grid}, keeping the same colour scale. The jet structure is preserved across all resolutions; the medium and fine fields are nearly identical, see Table~\ref {tab:grid} for quantitative values.}}{17}{figure.caption.6}\protected@file@percent }
